# A count in a value the tracer does not read, the same for every thread,
# is that value as a symbol only where it is one value at every trip of
# every entry of the loop: not where an outer loop of 4 trips defines it
# (it read max(uniform(%r5@31), 1) per entry, where the inner count
# changes with the outer counter), nor where threads left the loop
# defining it at different trips (max(uniform(%r5@61), 1), where each
# thread has its own). Each unknown count names why.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/trip_uniform.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_1: // loop: trips 4 | warp * × lane * | exec 128/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_2: // loop: trips ? (uniform(%r5@31) is defined in an enclosing loop: div by a non-constant divisor) | warp * × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB1_1: // loop: trips ? (latch condition depends on special register %tid.x) | warp * × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB1_3: // loop: trips ? (uniform(%r5@61) differs between lanes: depends on %tid.x) | warp * × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
